    "description": {
      "value": "<p>以一个动作，你可以对距你30尺内的一名可见生物挥舞这张卡片。生物必须通过一次DC 17的感知豁免，否则在接下来的一分钟内，目标无法施法或使用魔法物品，在所有豁免检定上都有劣势，其他生物对其造成的所有伤害都有抗性。这一特性一经使用，直到次日黎明之前无法再次使用。</p><p>As an action, you can brandish this card at one creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself. The target must succeed on a [[/save ability=wis dc=17]] saving throw, or for the next minute, the target can't cast spells or activate magic items, it has disadvantage on all saving throws, and other creatures have resistance to all damage it deals. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p>",
